    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the enlightenment influence doesnt explain the specific scaling. if you look at the distances between the monuments and how the radial avenues extend out, there are these repeating proportions that match common antenna resonance patterns. its too precise to be just 'symbolic'. if we treated the main axis as a center point, could we actually calculate a resonant frequency based on the total length of the primary circuits? like, if you treat the city as a giant conductor, what would its fundamental frequency be?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
